1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:01,749
Owe taxes this year?

2
00:00:02,169 --> 00:00:09,128
First, file on time even if you can't pay. The late-filing penalty is usually about ten times the late-payment one.

3
00:00:09,548 --> 00:00:16,002
Then compare. $2,400 on a credit card at $450 a month: about $215 in fees and interest.

4
00:00:16,422 --> 00:00:19,083
An IRS short-term plan: about $86.

5
00:00:19,853 --> 00:00:23,897
Check current fees at IRS.gov. Full video on my channel.
